				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..5;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "v",
					"expression": "eval:a*(q)^r;d"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(10*(v)-floor(10*(v))-0.5) > 0.05",
				"mod(round(10*abs(v)),10) != 0",
				"abs(v) < 10000",
				"abs(v) > 1"
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour une suite géométrique, $u_n=u_0\\times q^n$ : on multiplie $u_0$ par la raison $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{q}}}$, ${{r}}$ fois de suite.",
					"$u_{ {{r}} }={{a}}\\times\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\left({{q}}\\right)}^{ {{r}} }\\approx{{eval:round(1000*(v))/1000;a3}}$, soit $u_{ {{r}} }\\approx{{eval:round(10*(v))/10;a1}}$ au dixième."
